        "created_at": "2021-10-29T23:26:18.297Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you have a die in a power I’d say it tells more about your control rather than how potent it is necessarily.   Like someone making Hulk could give a d6 in Strength because while ultimately known as being very strong is very reckless in how he uses it.   Outside of reactions also keep in mind you build a dice pool of a power, quality, and status die for rolls made for actions.</p>",
