        "cooked": "<p>Thanks!  That really helps. Just got to change my mindset from the old “hard” numbers like Champions to this more open-ended system.  The next hard part will be to get my players into the same mindset. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
